"coverage" = share of parcels the rule labels at all. A rule that says
nothing about a parcel cannot be right about it, and 60% of the city was
uncovered until v8.

Batch 1 is optimistic for v6 (it chose the scrub fix) and for v7 (it fitted
the gate). Batch 2 and 3 are clean tests. v7 does not survive batch 2 and is
rejected; v8 is confirmed by batch 3 at 90% precision on new ground.
